        "body": "**Additional Suggestion:**\n\nThe workspace\\-mismatch guard added in `NavigationContext` never reaches the panel content render path\\, so a panel route pointing to a session in a different workspace still renders that foreign session\\'s `ChatPage` instead of the route\\-unavailable surface\\.\n\n<!-- VADE-CATEGORY: security -->\n<!-- VADE-GITHUB-SUGGESTION-ID:855b34d134a7713e13f5f679d586460afbbd79a3ec8b8a8164d24ca9a39bf098 -->\n\n<!-- VADE-RECOMMENDATION: FIX -->\n\n<a href=\"https://vercel.com/0xdx/~/agent/tasks/364a5fae-963b-4c42-9df7-87db846a67a9\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://vercel.com/vercel-agent-view-suggestion-dark\">\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://vercel.com/vercel-agent-view-suggestion-light\">\n    <img src=\"https://vercel.com/vercel-agent-view-suggestion-light\" alt=\"Fix on Vercel\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" />\n  </picture></a>\n<!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-ACTIVE -->\n<!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-SHA:1ce30492f8d186dccb74afce98cfdabf90d35743 -->\n<!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-BASE-SHA:b1526a85f6db5a6cdf668438e484f62ce15e6f29 -->\n<!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-REVIEW-ID:e7576c0b42ec022bf95e303bec07c520 -->\n<!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-TASK-ID:364a5fae-963b-4c42-9df7-87db846a67a9 -->\n<!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-VERSION:v2 -->",
